# Birrcare settings (.env), read by scripts/setup-env.sh and checked in CI
# (scripts/tests/env-schema.test.sh): every setting the app reads must be here,
# so an update can never add one without its question.
#
# KEY|kind|required|default|validator|question (en)|question (ar)
#   kind:      ask (asked) | secret (asked, hidden, typed twice) | generate (made
#              by the script) | locked (must keep its safe value) | default (not
#              asked; --reconfigure KEY to change)
#   required:  yes | no | first-run (only before the database exists) | if:KEY
#   default:   a value, or @detect-tz | @emergency-for-tz | @random48
APP_TIMEZONE|ask|yes|@detect-tz|tz|Household time zone (where the patient lives)|المنطقة الزمنية للمنزل (حيث يعيش المريض)
SUPER_ADMIN_USER|ask|first-run|admin|name|Name of the first admin (Super Admin)|اسم المشرف الأول (المشرف العام)
SUPER_ADMIN_PIN|secret|first-run||pin4|4-digit PIN for the first admin|رمز من 4 أرقام للمشرف الأول
EMERGENCY_NUMBER|ask|yes|@emergency-for-tz|phone|Emergency number to call in a crisis|رقم الطوارئ عند الأزمة
DOCTOR_NAME|ask|no||text|Doctor's name (Enter to skip)|اسم الطبيب (Enter للتخطي)
DOCTOR_PHONE|ask|no||phone|Doctor's phone (Enter to skip)|هاتف الطبيب (Enter للتخطي)
CF_ACCESS_TEAM_DOMAIN|ask|no||domain|Cloudflare Access team domain, e.g. family.cloudflareaccess.com (Enter to skip)|نطاق فريق Cloudflare Access (Enter للتخطي)
CF_ACCESS_AUD|ask|if:CF_ACCESS_TEAM_DOMAIN||aud|Cloudflare Access application AUD tag (64 characters)|رمز AUD لتطبيق Cloudflare Access (64 حرفاً)
PUSH_CONTACT|ask|no||email-or-url|Contact email for lock-screen alerts (Enter to skip)|بريد التواصل لتنبيهات شاشة القفل (Enter للتخطي)
TRUSTED_HOME_IP|ask|no||ips|Home internet IP for one-tap switching (Enter to skip)|عنوان IP للمنزل للتبديل بلمسة (Enter للتخطي)
TRUSTED_HOME_SUBNETS|default|no||cidrs||
PUBLIC_URL|ask|no||https-url|Public address of the app, e.g. https://care.example.com (Enter to skip)|عنوان التطبيق على الإنترنت، مثل https://care.example.com (Enter للتخطي)
SESSION_SECRET|generate|yes|@random48|secret48||
AUTH_DEV_FALLBACK|locked|yes|false|false-only||
CF_ACCESS_TRUST_EMAIL_HEADER|locked|yes|false|false-only||
DISABLE_2FA_FOR|locked|no||empty-in-normal-runs||
CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS|default|no||origins||
